# The generated content tree is compared as text by src/content-tree/scaffold.ts, which
# writes LF. This repo sets core.autocrlf=true, so without this a fresh clone on Windows
# would check every generated file out with CRLF, and the generator would then treat the
# whole tree as hand-edited. Scoped to what the generator owns — nothing else in the repo
# is renormalised.
content/docs/** text eol=lf
